WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:01.793
- I'm Terry Crews.

00:00:01.793 --> 00:00:03.607
A lot of people think I'm intimidating.

00:00:03.607 --> 00:00:06.397
Well I don't tend to agree with that.

00:00:06.397 --> 00:00:08.230
Let's prove 'em wrong.

00:00:12.365 --> 00:00:13.448
Yo listen up!

00:00:15.446 --> 00:00:17.051
I don't wanna interrupt.

00:00:17.051 --> 00:00:19.618
I'm just here to prove something.

00:00:19.618 --> 00:00:23.785
The question I have for the
day, is do I intimidate you?

00:00:29.919 --> 00:00:33.234
I yell good things, motivational stuff.

00:00:33.234 --> 00:00:37.401
I yell it in their face so
they know it and they feel it.

00:00:39.753 --> 00:00:42.587
Oh, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.

00:00:42.587 --> 00:00:46.774
But the world doesn't know
that I'm the most motivational,

00:00:46.774 --> 00:00:49.910
non-intimidating brother in the world!

00:00:49.910 --> 00:00:54.822
When I slam my hand down,
which really is just a symbol

00:00:54.822 --> 00:00:57.471
of, you know, kind of camaraderie.

00:00:57.471 --> 00:00:59.887
Kinda like a high-five for the workplace.

00:00:59.887 --> 00:01:00.720
Right there!

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:01.553
Hey!

00:01:01.553 --> 00:01:03.284
It's camaraderie.

00:01:03.284 --> 00:01:04.890
Don't you ever say I'm intimidating!

00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:06.410
Ever!

00:01:06.410 --> 00:01:09.898
You've stopped working
and you're looking at me.

00:01:09.898 --> 00:01:14.070
So am I intimidating to you or something?

00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:15.676
That's the right answer, boy.

00:01:15.676 --> 00:01:16.959
That's the right answer.

00:01:16.959 --> 00:01:18.144
That made me happy!

00:01:18.144 --> 00:01:20.899
The other question is
are you just saying that

00:01:20.899 --> 00:01:23.066
because I'm standing here?

00:01:31.859 --> 00:01:34.191
Does this intimidate you?

00:01:34.191 --> 00:01:35.297
Does that intimidate?

00:01:35.297 --> 00:01:37.759
Or is it this that intimidates you?

00:01:37.759 --> 00:01:41.904
Is it, you know, the fact that
I've been married 27 years

00:01:41.904 --> 00:01:44.654
with five kids and I'm a grandpa?

00:01:48.259 --> 00:01:50.270
That's what I'm talking about!

00:01:50.270 --> 00:01:52.437
I don't intimidate nobody!

00:01:53.474 --> 00:01:54.933
Security!

00:01:54.933 --> 00:01:57.505
I see you running around
here securing stuff.

00:01:57.505 --> 00:01:58.569
How you doing, man?

00:01:58.569 --> 00:02:01.995
I'm here to prove that I
don't intimidate people.

00:02:01.995 --> 00:02:03.826
You know shout it man, tell 'em.

00:02:03.826 --> 00:02:05.109
Tell 'em.

00:02:05.109 --> 00:02:09.759
No say it, say it, say it
for real, like get on 'em!

00:02:09.759 --> 00:02:11.183
You heard it from the man

00:02:11.183 --> 00:02:13.544
who will be the first one to kick me out

00:02:13.544 --> 00:02:16.628
if I was intimidating
any of the workers here.

00:02:16.628 --> 00:02:20.314
As you can see, nobody was intimidated.

00:02:20.314 --> 00:02:22.119
So if you ever talk that (bleep) again,

00:02:22.119 --> 00:02:24.355
you can just shut the (bleep) up!

00:02:24.355 --> 00:02:25.522
Whatcha doing?

00:02:26.427 --> 00:02:28.677
Do I intimidate you at all?

00:02:36.687 --> 00:02:37.520
I stand corrected.

